        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLG06, Delong Reeded Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe elegance of this simple design makes the Delong Reeded Pull a very popular choice for front door handles on homes and in commercial settings. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. This Delong Series 6 Ribbon Door Pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions DLG06 Reeded Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLG06-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262327\"><b>First Impressions DLG06 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-DLG06012:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-DLG06024:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-DLG06036:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
