                "description": "The elegance of this simple design makes the Delong Reeded Pull a very popular choice for front door handles on homes and in commercial settings. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass or metal doors. This Delong Series 6 Ribbon Door Pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths.",
